# Contact Form Email Service Configuration (Optional)
# Option 1: Web3Forms (Recommended, Free, Zero-backend required)
# 1. Sign up at https://web3forms.com to obtain an access key
# 2. Add your key below:
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=

# Option 2: Custom Serverless / Backend REST Endpoint
# If you run a custom serverless function (AWS Lambda, Cloudflare Worker, Vercel Function), specify the POST endpoint URL:
VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=

# Note: If neither variable is configured, the contact form automatically uses the transparent mailto fallback,
# prefilling Abdul's verified email (abdulrahumanrock15@gmail.com) with the sender's name, subject, and message.

